stopgx  - stopgx   - close graphics layer.
	- stopgx [none]
stopvl  - stopvl   - close video layer.
	- stopvl [layer]
stopvo  - stopvo   - close interface of vo device.
	- stopvo [none]
tftpboot- boot image via network using TFTP protocol
tftpdownload- auto upgrade file from tftp to flash
update  - update  - update image

usb     - USB sub-system
usbboot - boot from USB device
usbrestore- usbrestore  - update image

version - print monitor, compiler and linker version
watchdog- open or colse the watchdog
